{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人連敬涵於節目中推介江西銅業(358)，指美國關稅預期引發環球搶銅潮，導致部分交易所庫存下跌放大銅價彈性。長遠來看，AI基建與能源轉型刺激需求，銅價長線利好。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">連敬涵建議現價即38元買入，目標價上望42元，若失守35元便止蝕。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"4323.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026hf6TCVHs4y1789022953.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4323.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">江西銅業(358)</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人買賣策略</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">買入：$38</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">目標：$42</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">止蝕：$35</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"4324.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026Bi2UkILT4z1789022968.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4324.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人趙晞文推介中國神華(1088)，一來股份有「中特估」概念，基本面上就受惠煤價回升，國策亦推動行業發展。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">趙晞文建議現價即45.5元便可買入，目標價看50元，止蝕價定於41.5元。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"4325.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/202618iKlJIyQd1789022984.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4325.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">中國神華(1088)</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人買賣策略</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">買入：$45.5</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">目標：$50</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">止蝕：$41.5</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"4326.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/20264oH4nkt3Ji1789022998.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4326.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-10T08:19:53.207649+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":291,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}